This package is an experiment shell for NOvA ND JAX simulation and calibration. It
depends on (and does not vendor) shared generators and libraries:

- BdNMC / bdnmc-jax (RobMina/BdNMC)
- ldmgen (https://github.com/RobMina/ldmgen)
- bdnmc-nova (RobMina/bdnmc-nova) — HEPEVT file writers and two-stage jobs
- hep-simlib / hep-simbench / hep-endpoints / cryjax (as those land in the NOvA track)

The on-device detector simulation (`detsim/`) is written here. The stock collaboration
detector simulation that reads those files is run, unchanged, only as the validation
reference and production path until the on-device simulation is validated against it.

Collaboration-internal inputs (geometry, job configuration, conditions, calibration
tables, data results)
are not part of this repository. They belong in a separate private inputs
bundle when that exists (see setup/README.md).

Optional runtime dependencies (not vendored): RobMina/bdnmc-nova, RobMina/hep-simbench,
and RobMina/ldmgen (`novafastsim-ldm[ldmgen]`).
